em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">證交所表示，為加速台灣資本市場雙語化並提升金融競爭力，明（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">1</span>）日起，凡<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">108</span>年底實收資本額達<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">150</span>億元以上的上市公司，發布重大訊息均須中、英文同步發布；提醒上市公司及早因應，以利及時發送重大訊息。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p jhenghei=\\\"\\\" microsoft=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p jhenghei=\\\"\\\" microsoft=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">證交所今年初修正「對有價證券上市公司重大訊息之查證暨公開處理程序」部分條文，分四階段實施上市公司重大訊息「雙語化」，第一階段將於<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">7</span>月<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">1</span>日起上路，也就是明天開始，資本額達標準的上市公司均須齊步發布英文重大訊息。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p jhenghei=\\\"\\\" microsoft=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p jhenghei=\\\"\\\" microsoft=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">經統計，第<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">1</span>階段適用公司有<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">86</span>家，加上目前已發布英文重大訊息的上市公司，共計<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">343</span>家，達整體上市公司的<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">36%</span>，市值涵蓋全體上市公司則達到<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">85%</span>。有利外資即時掌握企業資訊，提升我國資本市場國際化。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p jhenghei=\\\"\\\" microsoft=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p jhenghei=\\\"\\\" microsoft=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">證交所指出，第二階段雙語化規劃明（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">110</span>）年起生效，除前述已適用公司，持續遵循雙語規範，<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">109</span>年底實收資本額達<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">100</span>億元以上、或<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">109</span>年度召開股東常會股東名簿記載之外資及陸資持股比率合計<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">30%</span>之上市公司，也將適用。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p jhenghei=\\\"\\\" microsoft=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p jhenghei=\\\"\\\" microsoft=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">第三階段則自後（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">111</span>）年生效，加入<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">110</span>年底及<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">111</span>年底實收資本額達<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">20</span>億元以上、或<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">110</span>年及<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">111</span>年召開股東常會時股東名簿記載之外資及陸資持股比率合計達<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">30%</span>以上者。於次年起，即分別於<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">111</span>年及<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">112</span>年適用發布英文重大訊息。第四階段自<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">113</span>年生效，全體上市公司都適用發布英文重訊。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p jhenghei=\\\"\\\" microsoft=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體